{
  "name": "Client onboarding kit",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Client onboarding kit\n\n**What it does**\nOne form submission sets up a new client: a Google Drive folder, a Notion page with a kickoff checklist, a welcome email to the client and a heads-up in Slack.\n\n**You need**\nGoogle Drive, Notion, Gmail and Slack credentials in n8n. A Notion database for clients with the properties listed in the README.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect the four credentials.\n2. Set your parent Drive folder in **Create client folder** and your Notion clients database in **Create client page**.\n3. Open the form URL from **New client form**, submit a test client, then activate.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "dcdd7cf8-0f8b-42bb-a8c6-4b11d856e821",
      "name": "Client onboarding kit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\n**Create client folder**: paste the ID of the folder that holds all client folders.\n**Create client page**: pick your Clients database. Property names must match the README.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "f25ffbca-dbe4-48e6-a923-00005788abae",
      "name": "Edit me: Drive and Notion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nRewrite the welcome email and set the Slack channel.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 430,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "127deeac-e32c-401f-a963-2568f8716f8f",
      "name": "Edit me: welcome email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "New client onboarding",
        "formDescription": "Fill this in when a deal closes. It creates the client folder, the Notion page and sends the welcome email.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Company name",
              "fieldName": "company",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "Example Co"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Contact full name",
              "fieldName": "contact_name",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "Jane Doe"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Contact email",
              "fieldName": "contact_email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "jane@example.com"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Package",
              "fieldName": "package",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "requiredField": true,
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "Starter"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Growth"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "Custom"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Start date",
              "fieldName": "start_date",
              "fieldType": "date",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Notes for the team",
              "fieldName": "notes",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false,
          "buttonLabel": "Set up client",
          "respondWithOptions": {
            "values": {
              "formSubmittedText": "Done. The folder, Notion page and welcome email are on their way."
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "33665f22-0a83-4fb6-aac5-203789f41971",
      "name": "New client form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "23619067-fb46-4768-bef7-940d9f3da89f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "company",
              "name": "company",
              "value": "={{ $json.company.trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "contactName",
              "name": "contactName",
              "value": "={{ $json.contact_name.trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "firstName",
              "name": "firstName",
              "value": "={{ $json.contact_name.trim().split(' ')[0] }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "email",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.contact_email.trim().toLowerCase() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "package",
              "name": "package",
              "value": "={{ $json.package }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "startDate",
              "name": "startDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.start_date }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "notes",
              "name": "notes",
              "value": "={{ $json.notes || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "folderName",
              "name": "folderName",
              "value": "={{ $json.company.trim() }} ({{ $json.start_date.slice(0, 7) }})",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bd7f9e69-32a6-4860-af76-b99a9de34807",
      "name": "Tidy the client details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "folder",
        "name": "={{ $json.folderName }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "My Drive",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_CLIENTS_FOLDER_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bd56f184-c878-440c-ab5b-e7101ae5ed5c",
      "name": "Create client folder",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleDriveOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Drive account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "databasePage",
        "operation": "create",
        "dataSourceId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_NOTION_DATA_SOURCE_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "title": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.company }}",
        "propertiesUi": {
          "propertyValues": [
            {
              "key": "Contact|rich_text",
              "textContent": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.contactName }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Email|email",
              "emailValue": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.email }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Package|select",
              "selectValue": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.package }}"
            },
            {
              "key": "Start date|date",
              "date": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.startDate }}",
              "includeTime": false
            },
            {
              "key": "Drive folder|url",
              "urlValue": "=https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/{{ $json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "contentType": "markdown",
        "markdown": "=## Kickoff checklist\n- [ ] Welcome email sent (automatic)\n- [ ] Kickoff call booked\n- [ ] Access to tools and accounts received\n- [ ] First deliverable scheduled\n- [ ] Invoice sent\n\n## Notes from sales\n{{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.notes || 'None' }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "0755b581-1189-4275-a4e7-b741fbf75cc9",
      "name": "Create client page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.notion",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "notionApi": {
          "name": "Notion account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Welcome aboard, {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.company }}",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<p>Hi {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.firstName }},</p>\n<p>Welcome, we are glad to be working with {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.company }}. Here is what happens next:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>We will send you a link to book a 30 minute kickoff call this week.</li>\n<li>Please share any logins, brand files or documents in your shared folder: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/{{ $('Create client folder').item.json.id }}\">open your folder</a>.</li>\n<li>We start work on {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.startDate }}.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>If you have a question before then, just reply here.</p>\n<p>Best,<br>Your name<br>Your company</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "6fe0851b-6cf9-49b6-a283-7da4dafa6254",
      "name": "Send welcome email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "name": "Gmail account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#clients",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "messageType": "text",
        "text": "=:tada: New client: *{{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.company }}* ({{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.package }}), starts {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.startDate }}\nContact: {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.contactName }}, {{ $('Tidy the client details').item.json.email }}\nNotion: {{ $('Create client page').item.json.url }}\nDrive: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/{{ $('Create client folder').item.json.id }}",
        "otherOptions": {
          "includeLinkToWorkflow": false
        }
      },
      "id": "1fd533e7-f42c-4e9b-a92b-bbe4fd4c56f3",
      "name": "Tell the team in Slack",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.7,
      "position": [
        1100,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "slackApi": {
          "name": "Slack account"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
